Hi {Owner},

I build websites for therapists and counseling practices around {City}. I could only find {Business Name} on a directory, with nowhere of your own where someone could read how you work and reach out privately.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: your specialties and approaches in plain words, a private consultation request that asks for nothing clinical, a fees and superbills explainer, telehealth details, and a clear notice that the site isn't an emergency service. It uses marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would a short call after your sessions one evening suit?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
